  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 泡沫初现与地缘政治动荡并行 / AI Hype Peaks as Geopolitical Tensions Escalate",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球局势动荡，科技、财经与政局相互交织。科技界 AI 热度持续但市场出现降温信号，大型上市遇阻与并购案频发；财经领域因高利率环境，企业融资成本激增，零售表现虽强劲但消费端压力渐显；政治上，中东局势升级引发巴林工业设施遇袭，欧洲多地爆发生活成本抗议，全球气候协议陷入僵局。\n\nGlobal developments today reveal a complex interplay between slowing tech enthusiasm, financial volatility, and heightened geopolitical instability. While the AI sector grapples with market corrections and massive capital requirements, the broader economy faces mounting pressure from high borrowing costs and consumer dissatisfaction. Meanwhile, renewed tensions in the Middle East and a deadlock in climate negotiations highlight the increasing fragility of the global order.",
